<title>MEXICO: Ceramic Q3, 9-mo net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Ceramic Q3, 9-mo net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>-</p>
<p>				 Q3 1996		     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    Shr			    n.a		     n.a.</p>
<p>    Oper Income	     20 million     loss    12.5 million</p>
<p>    Net profit	    15.1 million	loss    21.4 million</p>
<p>    Revs			   n.a		     n.a.</p>
<p>			     9-mo 1996		   9-mo 1995</p>
<p>    Shr			    n.a		     n.a.</p>
<p>    Oper Income	     54 million     loss    27.1 million</p>
<p>    Net profit	    95.6 million     loss    95.9 million</p>
<p>    Revs			   n.a		     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Revenues in Q3 were up 44.3 percent compared with the same period in 1995, and in the first nine months they were up 24.5 percent, the company said.</p>
<p>Full company name is Internacional de Ceramica.</p>
<p>-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560</p>
</text>
